	<script type="text/javascript"> Cufon.refresh(); </script>
	<div class="postdivider"></div>	<!-- begin post -->
	<div id="post-1321" class="post frontpage normal  hentry p2 post publish author-admin category-uncategorized tag-how-to-get-a-psychic-reading y2011 m10 d23 h14 alt"> 	<div class="post-title cufonheading"><h2><a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/2011/10/23/how-to-get-a-psychic-reading-online-do-this-but-dont-overdo-it/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to How to Get a Psychic Reading Online (Do THIS But DON&#8217;T Overdo it)">How to Get a Psychic Reading Online (Do THIS But DON&#8217;T Overdo it)</a></h2><div class="comment"><a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/2011/10/23/how-to-get-a-psychic-reading-online-do-this-but-dont-overdo-it/#respond" title="Comment on How to Get a Psychic Reading Online (Do THIS But DON&#8217;T Overdo it)">0</a></div></div>   
    <div class="meta"><div class="alignleft">October 23, 2011 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Psychic News" rel="category tag">Psychic News</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/2011/10/23/how-to-get-a-psychic-reading-online-do-this-but-dont-overdo-it/#respond" title="Comment on How to Get a Psychic Reading Online (Do THIS But DON&#8217;T Overdo it)">No Comments</a>     &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a name="fb_share" type="icon_link" href="http://www.facebook.com/sharer.php">Share</a><script src="http://static.ak.fbcdn.net/connect.php/js/FB.Share" type="text/javascript"></script>    
</div><div class="clear"></div></div>		<p><a href="http://psychicaccess.com/index.php?aff=pws02660&amp;track" target="_blank"><img class="alignright size-medium wp-image-1322" title="psychic access-1" src="http://suddenlypsychic.com/wp-content/uploads/psychic-access-1-300x292.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="292" /></a>If you are serious about getting a psychic reading online, but DON&#8217;T want to get scammed, snookered or ripped off by fakes and frauds, I&#8217;m going to describe and detail EVERYTHING you need to know, immediately below.  This is not only the exact same process I follow when seeking out new psychics myself, it&#8217;s the exact process and protocol I&#8217;ve followed for 20 years, as a writer, researcher and explorer of psychic phenomena, both personally&#8230;and professionally alike.</p>
<p><em>If you are serious about finding genuine psychics who WILL amaze you, this is the stone cold simple outline I recommend, and it works wonderfully well!</em></p>
<p>Ready?  Continue reading as we take a closer look.</p>
<p><strong>What to do FIRST:</strong></p>
<p>The first step in getting a psychic reading online is research.  You&#8217;ve got to do a little bit of due diligence BEFORE you call a psychic (or service) simply to make sure you aren&#8217;t wasting your time, or your money.</p>
<p><strong>But, as I point out above, DON&#8217;T &#8220;overdo&#8221; it either.  </strong></p>
<p>Lots of folks waste hours, days, and even weeks trying to pick the perfect reader, and the truth is, he or she does NOT exist.  A good reading is about relationship, rapport and connection, and you&#8217;ll never know how strong any of those 3 things are until you get them on the phone.  (or see someone face to face)</p>
<p>What to do NEXT:</p>
<p>Set a budget.  This is critical, and unfortunately&#8230;.the part where most people will drop the ball.  You know your bank account better than I do of course,  but set a small budget around what you are comfortable spending, and stick to it.  I recommend anywhere from 10-30 dollars for an initial reading, as you can get GREAT prices if you follow the simple recommendation in the next step.</p>
<p><strong>Seek out psychic services that offer GREAT guarantees, and first time caller inducements.</strong></p>
<p>In other words, pick psychics that not only stand behind their readings 100%, but that offer deeply discounted rates for first time callers and clients.  You can save up to 80% on your initial reading following this approach, making a 10 or 20 dollar budget MORE than enough to get a great &#8220;taste&#8221; of how good a reader really is.  And, if you go with a guaranteed service, if the reading is NOT up to par, you get your money back anyway!  (a true &#8220;no lose&#8221; proposition, and why I only recommend psychic services that offer both of these to MY fans, friends and followers)</p>
<p>Do THIS last:</p>
<p>Write down 5 questions you desperately want answers.  If you can get 3 really good, informative and enlightening answers to these 5 questions, I always consider the reading to be a success.  But writing down your most pressing problems, or questions is a GREAT way to get hyper focused as well, and a great way of asking the &#8220;Universe&#8221; for help&#8230;&#8230;BEFORE the actual reading begins!</p>
<div class="clear"></div>    	    
	</div>
	<!-- end post -->

	
	<div class="postdivider"></div>	<!-- begin post -->
	<div id="post-1318" class="post frontpage normal  hentry p3 post publish author-admin category-astral-body category-astral-projection category-astral-travel untagged y2011 m10 d19 h04"> 	<div class="post-title cufonheading"><h2><a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/2011/10/19/can-i-become-psychic-2-weird-ways-to-develop-psychic-powers-strange-but-true/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Can I Become Psychic? &#8211; 2 Weird Ways to Develop Psychic Powers (Strange but True!)">Can I Become Psychic? &#8211; 2 Weird Ways to Develop Psychic Powers (Strange but True!)</a></h2><div class="comment"><a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/2011/10/19/can-i-become-psychic-2-weird-ways-to-develop-psychic-powers-strange-but-true/#respond" title="Comment on Can I Become Psychic? &#8211; 2 Weird Ways to Develop Psychic Powers (Strange but True!)">0</a></div></div>   
    <div class="meta"><div class="alignleft">October 19, 2011 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/category/astral-projection/astral-body/" title="View all posts in Astral Body" rel="category tag">Astral Body</a>, <a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/category/astral-projection/" title="View all posts in Astral Projection" rel="category tag">Astral Projection</a>, <a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/category/astral-projection/astral-travel/" title="View all posts in Astral Travel" rel="category tag">Astral Travel</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="http://suddenlypsychic.com/2011/10/19/can-i-become-psychic-2-weird-ways-to-develop-psychic-powers-strange-but-true/#respond" title="Comment on Can I Become Psychic? &#8211; 2 Weird Ways to Develop Psychic Powers (Strange but True!)">No Comments</a>     &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a name="fb_share" type="icon_link" href="http://www.facebook.com/sharer.php">Share</a><script src="http://static.ak.fbcdn.net/connect.php/js/FB.Share" type="text/javascript"></script>    
</div><div class="clear"></div></div>		<blockquote><p>Can anyone become psychic, or do you need to be born that way? Which techniques are proven to help people develop psychic, or intuitive abilities? Is trying to become psychic on your own dangerous, or is that all a bunch of new age nonsense and NOT something to worry about at all?</p></blockquote>
<p>Any of these questions sound familiar? If you are anything like I once was, and fascinated by the various types of reported psychic abilities and want to experience them on your own, these sorts of questions are far more common than many people know. Exploring your own psychic potential is one of the most exciting, exhilarating and eye opening adventures a person can have, and I&#8217;m going to share <strong>with you 2 of the most powerful practices I used to develop my OWN inherent abilities, immediately below.</strong></p>
<p><strong>A great way to naturally develop your psychic powers?</strong></p>
<p>Meditation. And very specific types of mediation as well. Believe it or not, I&#8217;ve been meditating for about 20 years now, but it wasn&#8217;t <a href="http://thewholetruth.info/astral" target="_blank"><strong>until I started using very specific tools and techniques that my intuitive abilities began to flower</strong></a>. The tools and techniques I used? Using brain entrainment sound technology (commonly called binaural beats or hemi-sync) was the most profound and beneficial change I made to my meditative practice. (and I literally had my first psychic experience, probably within 3 days of beginning)</p>
<p>Remember, most scientists who study psychic abilities believe that the brain is a filter, or a reducing valve and lets in (or in most cases, keeps OUT) the psychic signals that are coming from the wild and wooly world around us. Using sound to tune your brain to a different frequency seems to allow MUCH of these signals to filter through, and you&#8217;ll be amazed at what can happen thereafter. (I&#8217;ve had <a href="http://thewholetruth.info/astral-outofbodyexperience">out of body experience</a>s, <a href="http://thewholetruth.info/astral-project">astral projection</a>s and precognitive dreams r<strong>egularly ever since beginning with binaural beats)(</strong></p>
<p><strong>The EASIEST way to cultivate your own psychic abilities with the minimum amount of practice possible?</strong></p>
<p>Speak to other psychics! Opening yourself up conversationally, or allowing your energy to be read by other gifted intuitives is an amazing way to open up the psychic channels (or chakras) in your energy body&#8230;.and believe me, I was a skeptic of ALL of this stuff until I experienced it firsthand. Talking to a psychic medium many years ago who told me things about a loved one I had lost very prematurely&#8230;&#8230;opened me up to seeing (and hearing) spirits myself, having all sorts of powerful precognitive experiences, and allowing the unseen spiritual world into my daily existence, pretty much right away!</p>
<div class="clear"></div>    	    
	</div>
